<h3>Kaiser Warm Spring</h3>
<p>About a half mile from the Jeep trail, we found the spring. A lot of algae was growing in it, but fresh, warm water was gushing from a rock to keep it filled. I removed the worst of the algae, also my shorts and shirt, and plopped myself into the water.</p>
